              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuJehu: Ngoba wenze kuhle lokho okulungileyo phambi kwami, wenza endlini kaAhabi okufunwa yinhliziyo yami, amadodana akho azabusa uIsrayeli kuze kube sesizukulwaneni sesine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
