              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusukela eJordani kusiya empumalanga, lonke ilizwe laseGileyadi, lakoGadi lakoRubeni lakoManase, kusukela eAroweri eliseduze lesihotsha saseArinoni, kanye leGileyadi leBashani.",
          "type": "text",
