              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaJehu, lakho akwenzayo, lobuqhawe bakhe, kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
